          "reason": "native-runtime: Effect hash collections and helpers replace native Set/Map/Object methods and native sorts under Short Law 10 and EF-38; the 2026-10-09 grilling ruling empties the port allowlist. Identity provenance and schema JSON changes are grouped separately."
