   `JsoncEdit.ts` defines the shared non-mutating span-replacement vocabulary (offset/length/content doubling as insert and delete, plus formatting options and ranges) and `JsoncFormatter.ts` computes the minimal whitespace edits to canonicalize a document. `applyAllResult` must apply edits in descending offset order — that is what keeps earlier offsets valid — and overlap detection exists even though neither producer ever emits overlapping edits.
